      "source": {
        "doc": "GV",
        "section": "Predicates",
        "note": "The field role is containment because GV Predicates says that contains is \"Derived from the asset hierarchy\" (lead decision D12). The field layoutRole is structure: the mockup lib/topology.js lines 24 and 1500 put this predicate in the structure family (lead decision D37)."
